@startuml
title Expense approval and balance effect
actor Reviewer
participant "Use case" as UC
participant "Expense" as E
participant "Approval policy" as A
participant "Balance effect ledger" as B
Reviewer -> UC: approve(expense, version)
UC -> E: verify PENDING
UC -> A: authorize reviewer
A --> UC: authorized
UC -> E: record decision APPROVED
UC -> B: apply once(effect identity)
B --> UC: committed
UC --> Reviewer: success or actionable error
@enduml
